[1.917, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[128C\u001b[33B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m◐ medium · /effort\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m❯ Build\u001b[9Ga\u001b[11Gweb\u001b[15GAPI\u001b[19Gfor\u001b[23Gsplitting\u001b[33Gexpenses.\u001b[43GUsers\u001b[49Gcreate\u001b[56Ggroups\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Gadd\u001b[71Gmembers.\u001b[80GAny\u001b[84Gmember\u001b[91Gcan\u001b[95Grecord\u001b[102Gan\u001b[105Gexpense\u001b[113Gwith\u001b[118Ga\u001b[120Gpayer,\u001b[127Gamount, description,\r\u001b[1B  and the members it's split equally between. Provide an endpoint showing each member's net balance in the group, and a settle-up endpoint\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  suggesting the minimum\u001b[26Gtransfers\u001b[36Gto\u001b[39Gclear\u001b[45Gall\u001b[49Gdebts.\u001b[56GMoney"]
